Southwest University Adult Lifespan Dataset (SALD)
==================================================

T1-weighted and resting-state fMRI of 494 healthy adults (19 to 80
years), acquired at Southwest University (Chongqing, China) on a 3T
Siemens Trio.

    Wei D, Zhuang K, Ai L, et al. (2018) Structural and functional brain
    scans from the cross-sectional Southwest University adult lifespan
    dataset. Sci Data 5:180134.
    https://doi.org/10.1038/sdata.2018.134

Downloaded by brainspresso from
s3://fcp-indi/data/Projects/INDI/SALD/RawData_BIDS/. The bucket has no
participants table (demographics are distributed on the INDI website).
